Z||000002||The Fieromaster||07-15-2001||11:18 AM||||I have a 4cylender 5 speed on my gt and we did a 4 to 6 swap on Fieromaster88's Fiero and used a 4 cylender's 5 speed there too!  ALL bolt up great BUT you do need the mount brackets from the 5 speed because others dont work!  So if you get the tranny get the metal brackets too!!<P>------------------<BR>      "Raced That, Wrecked Better"<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.askfelons.com/fieromaster/fieromastergif1.gif">      <BR>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000<BR>AIM: Fieromaster<BR>1985 GT ~Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)<BR>1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX (AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000||||reg||1
